IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q08-LOAN-REPAYMENT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL       PIC S9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-MONTHS          PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MONTHLY-PAY     PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-PAY        PIC Z(9)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL
ACCEPT WS-MONTHS
IF WS-MONTHS <= 0 OR WS-PRINCIPAL < 0
    DISPLAY "INVALID INPUT"
ELSE
    COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-PAY ROUNDED = WS-PRINCIPAL / WS-MONTHS
    MOVE WS-MONTHLY-PAY TO WS-DISP-PAY
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-PAY)
END-IF
STOP RUN.
